# Pairs with LivePublisherPinned. A soft delete retires the tree's leaf pins as if
# it were a purge, but a soft-deleted tree is recoverable: its leaves still need
# their WAL.
MODULE: LivePublisherPinnedSoftDeleteRetiresPin
TARGET: LivePublisherPinned
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a soft delete retires the leaf's pins
PERTURBS: SoftDelete

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "live"
    /\ phase' = "deleted"
    /\ UNCHANGED walVars
    /\ UNCHANGED <<inc, seeded, cp, need, purgeMark, owed, route>>
    /\ UNCHANGED pinVars
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase = "live"
    /\ phase' = "deleted"
    /\ UNCHANGED walVars
    /\ UNCHANGED <<inc, seeded, cp, need, purgeMark, owed, route>>
\* MUTATION: the soft delete retires the pins.
    /\ pinOff' = [kc \in Keys \X Cons |-> NoPin]
    /\ UNCHANGED pinInc
--- END
